id: god-bind
name: God Bind
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCostPerTier: 4
attacking: false
requiresTarget: true
usageLimit: 1/encounter
# A God Maneuver: open where an effect grants it, only in God Ki, its 4(T) paid in Divine Ki Points (maneuvers.mjs
# whyNotGod, spendManeuverCost). At an Opponent within your Melee Range, a Might Clash (chat.mjs postGodBind); won,
# Pinned, the one held marked `godBoundBy` and the binder `godBind`. At the start of each of your turns a card asks for
# the 2 Actions that keep it, or lets them go (chat.mjs godBindTurnStart); with fewer than 2 left, they go. Their Pinned
# Might Clash against you, won, frees them.
#
# Out of sequence: offered in Respond against an attack from an Opponent within your Melee Range, for 1 Counter Action
# and its DKP (chat.mjs playGodBindCounter) - that attack held for the Might Clash; lost by them, it is cancelled, its Ki
# Points and Actions gone; won by them, it goes on against your Dodge. Its 1/Encounter is the same one either way.
godManeuver: true
godBind: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A God Maneuver: a Might Clash at an Opponent in your Melee Range - won, Pinned while you spend 2 Actions each turn. Out
  of sequence for 1 Counter Action against their attack: lost by them, it is cancelled.
text: >
  God Bind [1/Encounter]: Restrain your enemies with divine force.
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –DKP Cost: 4(T)
  –Effect: Target an Opponent within your Melee Range. Make a Might Clash against that Opponent. If you win, they gain
  the Pinned Combat Condition. You must spend 2 Actions at the start of each of your turns to maintain the God Bind, if
  you choose not to, then the Character Pinned due to the effects of God Bind is freed.

  If an Opponent targets you with an Attacking Maneuver while inside of your Melee Range, you may use the God Bind
  Maneuver, targeting them, as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver by spending 1 Counter Action. If they lose the Might Clash,
  their Attacking Maneuver is canceled and they lose any Ki Points and Actions spent on it.
